config←ReadConfig;getEnv;folder;file
⍝ All build parameters (except DEV and RIDE, which stay plain environment
⍝ variables - see Build and Patch) live in a JSON file named by the
⍝ BUILD_CONFIG environment variable. See Claude/cleanup.md Phase 1.
getEnv←{2 ⎕NQ'.' 'GetEnvironment' ⍵}
folder←∊1 ⎕NPARTS getEnv 'BUILD_CONFIG'

:If ~⎕NEXISTS file←folder,'/linkbuild.json'
    ⎕←'*** BUILD_CONFIG file not found: ',file
    ⎕SIGNAL 11
:EndIf
config←⎕JSON 1⊃⎕NGET file
config.DEV←∨/'yY1'∊getEnv 'DEV'
config.configsource←1⊃1 ⎕NPARTS file
config.(delete←⎕VGET ⊂'delete' 1)
